msgid ":q closes the window (:q! without asking about its tabs), :qa quits Beluga, :e or :cd PATH opens a folder, :tabnew [PATH], :tabclose, :tabonly, :sp or :vs [PATH] split the view, :only closes the other view, :mkdir NAME, :touch NAME, :set hidden / nohidden / hidden!, :set view=icons|compact|details|columns, :sort name|size|date|type, :pwd, :term, :du, :help, :!COMMAND runs a shell command in the folder."
msgstr ":q tanca la finestra (:q! sense preguntar per les pestanyes), :qa surt del Beluga, :e o :cd CAMÍ obre una carpeta, :tabnew [CAMÍ], :tabclose, :tabonly, :sp o :vs [CAMÍ] divideixen la vista, :only tanca l'altra vista, :mkdir NOM, :touch NOM, :set hidden / nohidden / hidden!, :set view=icons|compact|details|columns, :sort name|size|date|type, :pwd, :term, :du, :help, :!ORDRE executa una ordre de l'intèrpret a la carpeta."

